		["My rune spells are: {Chameleon} Rune, {Destroy Field} Rune, {Energy Field} Rune, {Energy Wall} Rune, {Fire Bomb} Rune, {Fire Field} Rune, {Fire Wall} Rune, {Poison Field} Rune and {Poison Wall} Rune."] = "Minhas magias de rune são: {Chameleon} Rune, {Destroy Field} Rune, {Energy Field} Rune, {Energy Wall} Rune, {Fire Bomb} Rune, {Fire Field} Rune, {Fire Wall} Rune, {Poison Field} Rune e {Poison Wall} Rune.",
